-- Every room built on the room atom answers `look` here. A room's mix-ins
-- come first on its Message Path (the Garden Path is `garden_room fragrant`,
-- so fragrant's Script, then this one), and may answer or add to it.

use describe from rooms

on look role, actor
  if role is "room" then
    return describe(the target, actor)
  end if
  pass look
end look
